---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Jraft Creative — Marketing Agency Singapore"
  description="Learn about Jraft Creative — a full-service marketing agency in Singapore. We help businesses grow through web design, SEO, paid ads, social, and AI search."
  canonical="https://jraftcreative.com/about/"
  ogTitle="About Jraft Creative — Marketing Agency Singapore"
  ogDescription="Full-service marketing agency in Singapore. Web design, SEO, paid ads, social media, and AI search optimisation — all under one roof."
  keywords="about Jraft Creative, marketing agency Singapore, digital agency Singapore, who we are, Jraft Creative team"
  schemaData={schemaData}
>

  <!-- ========== HERO ========== -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-hero__content reveal">
        <p class="section-label">About Jraft Creative</p>
        <h1>Jraft Creative is the <span class="highlight">marketing team</span> that puts your <span class="highlight">strategy and business goals</span> before anything else.</h1>
        <p class="about-hero__subtitle">That sounds obvious &mdash; until you&rsquo;ve worked with an agency that runs the same playbook on every client. We don&rsquo;t. The work starts with your numbers, your market, and what you&rsquo;re actually trying to build. The campaigns, content, and channels come after that.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-hero__proof reveal" aria-label="Selected results">
          <div class="conveyor">
            <div class="conveyor__track">
              <div class="proof-stat"><span class="num-text">$1M+</span><span class="lbl">Ad spend managed to date</span></div>
              <div class="proof-stat"><span class="num-text">89</span><span class="lbl">PIKE SIX pilates founding members &mdash; 19 days, pre-launch</span></div>
              <div class="proof-stat"><span class="num-text">86</span><span class="lbl">Enquiries for a beauty salon &mdash; in 1 month</span></div>
              <div class="proof-stat"><span class="num-text">45</span><span class="lbl">Music with Pat trial lessons &mdash; in 3 months</span></div>
              <div class="proof-stat proof-stat--accent"><span class="num-text num-text--sm">Recommended</span><span class="lbl">by ChatGPT, Gemini &amp; Google&rsquo;s AI Overview</span></div>
              <div class="proof-stat" aria-hidden="true"><span class="num-text">$1M+</span><span class="lbl">Ad spend managed to date</span></div>
              <div class="proof-stat" aria-hidden="true"><span class="num-text">89</span><span class="lbl">PIKE SIX pilates founding members &mdash; 19 days, pre-launch</span></div>
              <div class="proof-stat" aria-hidden="true"><span class="num-text">86</span><span class="lbl">Enquiries for a beauty salon &mdash; in 1 month</span></div>
              <div class="proof-stat" aria-hidden="true"><span class="num-text">45</span><span class="lbl">Music with Pat trial lessons &mdash; in 3 months</span></div>
              <div class="proof-stat proof-stat--accent" aria-hidden="true"><span class="num-text num-text--sm">Recommended</span><span class="lbl">by ChatGPT, Gemini &amp; Google&rsquo;s AI Overview</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== FOUNDERS STRIP ========== -->
  <section class="section founders-strip" aria-label="The person behind your business's winning strategy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="founders-grid">
        <div class="founder-text reveal">
          <h2 class="founders-heading">The <span class="highlight">person</span> behind your business's <span class="highlight">winning strategy</span>.</h2>
          <div class="founder-bio">
            <p>Jeremy founded Jraft Creative in 2025 after spending 10 years in sales and marketing roles across Singapore &mdash; the kind of work where you&rsquo;re personally on the hook for the pipeline every quarter, and the number at the end of it is yours to defend. Two chapters stand out: managing over $1 million in ad spend across paid search and social, and helping grow a business unit from zero to $2 million ARR in under a year. That&rsquo;s where the conviction came from &mdash; he&rsquo;d seen what marketing looks like when it&rsquo;s actually accountable to revenue, and what it looks like when it&rsquo;s a deck full of impressions.</p>
            <p>He started the agency because he kept seeing the same gap. Small businesses were getting outgunned by competitors with bigger budgets and dedicated teams, while the agencies they could afford either sold cookie-cutter templates or charged enterprise rates for work no senior person actually touched from one month to the next.</p>
            <p>So he built Jraft Creative to close that gap. Senior strategy, real ownership, no lock-in, no junior handoff. He runs strategy across every account, sits in the WhatsApp chat with most clients directly, and is the one you call when something needs a real decision.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="founder-media reveal">
          <div class="founder-photo">
            <img src="/images/founder.webp" alt="Jeremy Cheong, Founder of Jraft Creative" width="800" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
          <div class="founder-identity">
            <p class="founder-name">Jeremy Cheong</p>
            <p class="founder-title">Founder & Managing Director</p>
          </div>
          <blockquote class="founder-pullquote">&ldquo;If marketing isn&rsquo;t tied to the business under it, it&rsquo;s just decoration.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== TRUSTED BY ========== -->
  <section class="trust-by" aria-label="Trusted by businesses in Singapore">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="tb-label">Trusted by businesses in Singapore</p>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="tb-static">
        {clientLogos.map((logo) => (
          <img class="tb-logo" src={logo.src} alt={logo.alt} style={`--s:${logo.s}`} width="150" height="46" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        ))}
        <span class="tb-more">&hellip;and many more</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      function easeOut(t) { return 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3); }
      var reduce = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      function fmt(el, val) {
        var d = parseInt(el.getAttribute('data-decimals') || '0', 10);
        return (el.getAttribute('data-prefix') || '') + val.toFixed(d) + (el.getAttribute('data-suffix') || '');
      }
      function run(el) {
        var target = parseFloat(el.getAttribute('data-target')) || 0;
        if (reduce) { el.textContent = fmt(el, target); return; }
        var dur = 1600, start = null;
        function step(ts) {
          if (!start) start = ts;
          var p = Math.min((ts - start) / dur, 1);
          el.textContent = fmt(el, easeOut(p) * target);
          if (p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step); else el.textContent = fmt(el, target);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }
      var nums = document.querySelectorAll('#proof-band .num[data-target]');
      if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) { nums.forEach(run); return; }
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
        entries.forEach(function (e) { if (e.isIntersecting) { run(e.target); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
      }, { threshold: 0.5 });
      nums.forEach(function (n) { io.observe(n); });
    })();
  </script>

  <!-- ========== WHAT WE DO ========== -->
  <section class="section" style="background: rgba(13, 13, 20, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(2px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2px);" aria-label="What we do">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">What We Do</p>
        <h2>Full-Service, <span class="highlight">One Team</span></h2>
        <p>Everything your business needs to grow online &mdash; handled by one agency with one point of contact.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-services-grid">
        <div class="about-service-card reveal reveal-d1">
          <div class="about-service-card__media">
            <img src="/images/service-webdev.webp" alt="Hand-coded business website on a laptop screen — bespoke website development by Jraft Creative" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="450" />
          </div>
          <div class="about-service-card__body">
            <h3>Website Development</h3>
            <p>Custom websites, ecommerce stores, and web applications &mdash; hand-coded for speed, SEO, and conversions. No templates, no page builders.</p>
            <a href="/services/website-development" class="about-service-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-service-card reveal reveal-d2">
          <div class="about-service-card__media">
            <img src="/images/service-seo.webp" alt="Search engine results page with high-ranking organic listings — SEO and performance services by Jraft Creative" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="450" />
          </div>
          <div class="about-service-card__body">
            <h3>SEO &amp; Performance</h3>
            <p>Technical audits, on-page optimisation, local SEO, and performance tuning to get you found on Google and keep visitors on your site.</p>
            <a href="/services/seo-performance" class="about-service-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-service-card reveal reveal-d3">
          <div class="about-service-card__media">
            <img src="/images/service-ads.webp" alt="Google and Meta ad campaign performance dashboard — paid advertising management by Jraft Creative" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="450" />
          </div>
          <div class="about-service-card__body">
            <h3>Paid Ads</h3>
            <p>Google Ads, Meta Ads, TikTok, and YouTube &mdash; we manage your ad spend to deliver qualified leads and measurable ROI.</p>
            <a href="/services/paid-ads" class="about-service-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-service-card reveal reveal-d4">
          <div class="about-service-card__media">
            <img src="/images/service-social.webp" alt="Social media content grid across Instagram, TikTok and Facebook — social media services by Jraft Creative" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="450" />
          </div>
          <div class="about-service-card__body">
            <h3>Social Media</h3>
            <p>Content creation, Reels, TikToks, community management, and growth strategy for Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, and LinkedIn.</p>
            <a href="/services/social-media" class="about-service-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-service-card about-service-card--accent reveal reveal-d1">
          <div class="about-service-card__media">
            <img src="/images/service-seo.webp" alt="AI assistants recommending brands in chat answers — AI search optimisation (GEO) by Jraft Creative" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="450" />
          </div>
          <div class="about-service-card__body">
            <h3>AI Search Optimisation</h3>
            <p>Get your brand recommended by ChatGPT, Gemini, and Perplexity. We optimise your digital presence so AI engines cite and recommend you.</p>
            <a href="/services/ai-search-optimisation" class="about-service-link">Learn more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== WHY US ========== -->
  <section class="section" aria-label="Why choose us">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">Why Jraft Creative</p>
        <h2>What Makes Us <span class="highlight">Different</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-why-grid">
        <div class="about-why-item reveal reveal-d1">
          <h3>Transparent, Upfront Quotes</h3>
          <p>No hidden fees, no surprise invoices. We scope your project and give you a clear quote before any work starts &mdash; and the price we quote is the price you pay.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-why-item reveal reveal-d2">
          <h3>No Lock-in Contracts</h3>
          <p>We earn your business every month. No 12-month lock-ins, no cancellation penalties. Stay because of results, not because of a contract.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-why-item reveal reveal-d3">
          <h3>Fast Turnaround</h3>
          <p>Most websites launch within 2 weeks. Campaigns go live within days. We move quickly because your time matters.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-why-item reveal reveal-d1">
          <h3>Hand-Coded Quality</h3>
          <p>We don&rsquo;t use bloated WordPress themes or page builders. Every site is hand-coded for speed, scoring 90+ on Google PageSpeed out of the box.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-why-item reveal reveal-d2">
          <h3>Singapore-Focused</h3>
          <p>We understand local consumer behaviour, industry regulations, and the competitive landscape. Your project is handled by people who know Singapore.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-why-item reveal reveal-d3">
          <h3>Results Over Vanity</h3>
          <p>We don&rsquo;t chase likes &mdash; we chase leads, conversions, and revenue. Every decision is guided by data and your business goals.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== HOW WE WORK ========== -->
  <section class="section" style="background: rgba(13, 13, 20, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(2px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2px);" aria-label="How we work">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">How We Work</p>
        <h2>Simple, <span class="highlight">Transparent Process</span></h2>
        <p>From first call to launch in as fast as 2 weeks.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="hp-flow reveal">
        <li class="hp-step">
          <div class="hp-step-top"><span class="hp-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
          <h3>Discovery</h3>
          <p>A free consultation to understand your business, goals, and audience. We define the scope and give you a transparent quote.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="hp-step">
          <div class="hp-step-top"><span class="hp-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
          <h3>Design</h3>
          <p>Custom mockups tailored to your brand. We iterate on your feedback until every detail is right.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="hp-step">
          <div class="hp-step-top"><span class="hp-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
          <h3>Build</h3>
          <p>Hand-coded, mobile-responsive, and SEO-optimised. We test across devices and browsers before launch.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="hp-step">
          <div class="hp-step-top"><span class="hp-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
          <h3>Launch &amp; Support</h3>
          <p>We deploy, configure analytics, and provide training. Every project includes 30 days of free post-launch support.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <div class="section-cta reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
        <a href="/process/" class="btn btn-secondary">View Our Full Process</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== CTA ========== -->
  <section class="section cta-section" aria-label="Get started">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-box reveal">
        <p class="section-label">Ready to Get Started?</p>
        <h2>Let&rsquo;s Build Something Great Together</h2>
        <p>Book a free consultation and tell us about your project. No obligations &mdash; just a conversation about how we can help your business grow.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Book Your Consultation</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/6582234578?text=Hi%20Jraft%20Creative%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20learn%20more%20about%20your%20agency." class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WhatsApp Button -->
  <a href="https://wa.me/6582234578?text=Hi%20Jraft%20Creative%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20enquire%20about%20marketing%20services%20for%20my%20business." class="whatsapp-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Chat on WhatsApp" slot="after-footer">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="28" height="28" fill="#fff" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16.004 0h-.008C7.174 0 0 7.176 0 16.004c0 3.5 1.13 6.742 3.05 9.378L1.054 31.29l6.118-1.962A15.91 15.91 0 0 0 16.004 32C24.826 32 32 24.826 32 16.004S24.826 0 16.004 0zm9.302 22.602c-.39 1.1-2.276 2.106-3.156 2.17-.796.058-1.78.082-2.872-.278a26.3 26.3 0 0 1-2.6-1.074c-4.576-2.186-7.566-6.826-7.796-7.142-.222-.316-1.836-2.478-1.836-4.726 0-2.248 1.162-3.356 1.574-3.814.39-.434.858-.542 1.144-.542.286 0 .572.004.82.014.264.012.618-.1.966.738.39.938 1.294 3.224 1.408 3.458.112.234.19.508.038.82-.15.316-.226.512-.448.79-.222.278-.468.62-.668.832-.222.234-.454.49-.196.962.26.47 1.154 1.906 2.478 3.088 1.702 1.52 3.136 1.99 3.582 2.214.448.222.708.19.968-.114.26-.306 1.118-1.302 1.416-1.75.298-.448.596-.37.998-.222.404.148 2.566 1.21 3.006 1.432.44.222.734.334.844.518.112.186.112 1.074-.278 2.174z"/></svg>
  </a>

</BaseLayout>

<!-- Hide global grid bg on About page, per locked design pattern -->
<style is:global>
  .animated-bg__grid { display: none; }
</style>

<style>
  /* --- About Hero (editorial; matches site type system) --- */
  .about-hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 96px 0 40px;
    background: transparent;
  }

  .about-hero__content {
    max-width: 880px;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.6vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 16px 0 24px;
  }

  /* Brand-green highlight phrases — global .highlight rule is scoped to
     .hero / .section-header only, so we re-apply here for .about-hero and
     .founders-strip headers. Gradient text-fill matches the rest of the site. */
  .about-hero h1 .highlight,
  .founders-strip h2 .highlight,
  .about-story-centered .highlight,
  .about-story-centered h2 .highlight,
  .about-story-centered .section-label .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, #7adeb5 50%, var(--accent) 100%);
    background-size: 200% auto;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    color: var(--accent); /* fallback for browsers w/o background-clip:text */
  }

  .about-hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  /* Hero: copy in the container (left), conveyor pinned to the right edge */
  .about-hero > .container { width: 100%; }
  .about-hero__content { max-width: 600px; min-width: 0; }
  .about-hero__proof {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    left: max(58%, 640px);
    right: 0;
  }

  /* Vertical conveyor of result cards */
  .conveyor {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0, #000 10%, #000 90%, transparent 100%);
    mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0, #000 10%, #000 90%, transparent 100%);
  }
  .conveyor__track {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    width: max-content;
    animation: conveyor 26s linear infinite;
  }
  .conveyor .proof-stat {
    width: 216px;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    min-height: 172px;
    margin-right: 14px;
    padding: 22px 16px;
  }
  .conveyor .proof-stat .num-text { font-size: 2.1rem; }
  .conveyor .proof-stat .num-text--sm { font-size: 1.4rem; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.1; }
  .conveyor .proof-stat .lbl { font-size: 0.76rem; max-width: 26ch; }
  .conveyor:hover .conveyor__track { animation-play-state: paused; }
  @keyframes conveyor {
    from { transform: translateX(-50%); }
    to { transform: translateX(0); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .conveyor__track { animation: none; transform: translateX(-50%); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-hero { min-height: 0; display: block; padding: 120px 0 56px; }
    .about-hero__content { max-width: 720px; }
    .about-hero__proof {
      position: static; transform: none; left: auto; right: auto;
      margin-top: 32px; padding: 0 28px;
    }
  }

  /* --- Founders strip --- */
  .founders-strip {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 56px 0;
  }

  .founders-strip__header {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto 56px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .founders-strip__header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 12px 0 16px;
